<h2 id='what-is-moosend'>🏠 What Is Moosend?</h2>

<p>Moosend is a cloud-based email marketing and automation platform founded in 2011. It built its reputation on affordable pricing, a no-code automation workflow builder, and a deliverability infrastructure that competes with tools costing three times as much. For property managers, the relevant selling point is its ability to run complex, conditional drip sequences — the kind you need when a prospective tenant fills out an inquiry form at 11 PM and you want a five-step nurture sequence to fire before your leasing agent opens their laptop the next morning.</p>

<p>Moosend's free plan allows up to 1,000 subscribers with full automation access — unusual in this market. Paid plans scale on subscriber count rather than email volume, which matters when you're sending high-frequency maintenance updates to a large tenant base. We've covered Moosend extensively in our <a href='https://realestateopshub.com/reviews/moosend-review'>full Moosend review for property managers</a>, where we walked through its workflow builder in detail.</p>

