<h2 id='who-its-for'>🎯 Who Each Tool Is For</h2>

<p><strong>Choose Moosend if:</strong> You manage more than 100 units and want automated lease renewal sequences, conditional drip campaigns for prospects, and move-in/move-out email workflows without paying for a full marketing platform. Moosend is also the right call if you have a technical contact on your team who can use the API to push lease date data directly from your property management software.</p>

<p><strong>Choose AWeber if:</strong> You're newer to email marketing, run a smaller portfolio, and primarily send broadcast-style newsletters or announcements to owners and tenants. If your email strategy is largely "monthly update to our owner list" rather than "automated 60-day pre-lease-expiry campaign," AWeber's simplicity and deliverability track record may be sufficient — and its onboarding resources will get you productive faster.</p>

